    faq:[['What is the goal of blackjack?','Beat the dealer with a stronger hand without exceeding 21. Exactly 21 is not required.'],['How much is an ace worth?','An ace counts as 1 or 11, whichever produces the strongest valid hand.'],['Is blackjack the same as any 21?','No. A natural blackjack is an ace plus a ten-value card in the first two cards.'],['Does the dealer hit 17?','The dealer stands on hard 17. On soft 17, S17 means stand and H17 means hit.'],['Is 3:2 or 6:5 better?','3:2 is better: a 100 bet earns 150 instead of 120 for a natural blackjack.'],['Does basic strategy guarantee a win?','No. It improves decisions and can reduce the house edge, but it cannot guarantee a profitable session.']],
